# A production install tried out from deploy/compose (docs/0099): never commit these. Its .env is
# covered by `.env` above, at any depth. secrets/ and tls/ are named by path, not at any depth,
# so code folders with those names elsewhere aren't ignored by surprise.
deploy/compose/secrets/
deploy/compose/tls/
